config OPTICAL_FRONTEND_UX3320
	tristate "Xiamen UX UX3320B1 optical frontend"
	depends on I2C
	select FW_LOADER
	select OPTICAL_FRONTEND
	help
	  Support the UX3320B1 laser driver / limiting amplifier as an independent
	  optical frontend provider. Expose SFF-8472 telemetry and calibrated GPON
	  burst transmitter control. Load the board's final 768-byte register
	  image from NVMEM or firmware; no generic laser/APD calibration is used.
	  Missing calibration permits diagnostics but keeps the transmitter off.
	  UX3320S and EPON mode programming are not implemented.
